Contest 2: 4 in [1, 3]? No. Rating -> 4.
Contest 3: 4 in [3, 6]? Yes. Rating -> 5.
Contest 4: 5 in [2, 4]? No. Rating -> 5.
Contest 5: 5 in [4, 7]? Yes. Rating -> 6.
Final: 6.

