Contest 1: 2 in [1, 5]? Yes. Rating -> 3.
Contest 2: 3 in [1, 3]? Yes. Rating -> 4.
Contest 3: 4 in [3, 6]? Yes. Rating -> 5.
Contest 4: 5 in [2, 4]? No. Rating -> 5.
